      ],
      "text": "The Rust workspace contains the main `claw` CLI (rusty-claude-cli), an `api` crate for provider clients and streaming, a `runtime` crate with sessions and permission policy/enforcer, a `tools` crate, `claw-analog`, and `claw-rag-service`."
    },
