        "slc_01e359205c90db982bf3243fbe8a5d7b74e105869f98b53614cb5c15a94da6ee"
      ],
      "text": "The main `claw` CLI is described as a full agent with a REPL, OAuth, an extended toolset including bash, MCP and plugins, streaming, and integration with Anthropic, OpenAI-compatible, and xAI providers."
    },
