      ],
      "text": "claw-analog is a lean agent on the same API layer with a narrow filesystem-only toolset (read_file, list_dir, glob_workspace, grep_workspace, git_diff, git_log, optional write_file and retrieve_context) and no arbitrary shell, MCP, or plugins."
    },
