      ],
      "text": "claw-analog enforces a canonical workspace root with relative paths, no `..`, and symlink/canonicalize containment checks; a PermissionPolicy and PermissionEnforcer gate tools, and dangerous modes are blocked in non-interactive runs unless explicitly accepted."
    },
